        <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/LOAN/LoansGeneral/LoanApplications/UnderwritingAutomation> ,
        <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/LOAN/LoansGeneral/LoanApplications/TotalDebtExpenseRatio> .

